1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,554
Video ya leo inahusu furaha, huzuni, hasira na hisia. Usipoiangalia utakasirika.

2
00:00:10,554 --> 00:00:18,576
Katika sehemu fulani ya video, utauliza swali kwa Kijapani. Ukiskia, tafadhali uandike katika maoni.

3
00:00:19,196 --> 00:00:22,656
Mstari 1: Kupotea kwa Mwavuli na Jinsi ya Kukabiliana

4
00:00:23,015 --> 00:00:26,215
Aa, nitafanya nini sasa?

5
00:00:26,237 --> 00:00:28,478
Umepatwa na nini?

6
00:00:28,502 --> 00:00:32,553
Nimepoteza mwavuli wangu wa kupendeza.

7
00:00:32,577 --> 00:00:36,177
Eeh, mwavuli wa buluu ule?

8
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:39,400
Ndiyo, mwavuli ule.

9
00:00:39,423 --> 00:00:42,028
Ulipoteza wapi?

10
00:00:42,051 --> 00:00:45,107
Labda ndani ya gari la moshi.

11
00:00:45,130 --> 00:00:48,663
Umewahi kupiga simu kampuni ya gari moshi?

12
00:00:48,686 --> 00:00:51,863
Hapana, sijapiga bado.

13
00:00:51,887 --> 00:00:55,464
Ni bora upige simu mara moja.

14
00:00:55,487 --> 00:00:59,061
Lakini nadhani hautapatikana.

15
00:00:59,084 --> 00:01:02,451
Haitakuwa hivyo.

16
00:01:02,474 --> 00:01:06,330
Mwavuli ule ulikuwa muhimu kwangu sana.

17
00:01:06,353 --> 00:01:08,828
Ulinunua wapi?

18
00:01:08,852 --> 00:01:13,335
Nilipokea kama zawadi ya siku ya kuzaliwa mwaka jana kutoka dada yangu.

19
00:01:13,359 --> 00:01:16,218
Hii ni huzuni sana.

20
00:01:16,241 --> 00:01:19,857
Ndiyo, niko na mshtuko mkubwa.

21
00:01:19,881 --> 00:01:23,147
Usikate tamaa, tupige simu.

22
00:01:23,170 --> 00:01:26,857
Sijui nambari ya simu.

23
00:01:26,880 --> 00:01:30,520
Nitaangalia kwa simu yangu sasa hivi.

24
00:01:30,544 --> 00:01:32,211
Asante sana.

25
00:01:32,234 --> 00:01:36,167
Aa, nambari ipo.

26
00:01:36,190 --> 00:01:37,757
Kweli?

27
00:01:37,780 --> 00:01:41,079
Ndiyo, piga simu hapa.

28
00:01:41,103 --> 00:01:44,169
Ninahisi wasiwasi kidogo.

29
00:01:44,192 --> 00:01:48,088
Utawezekana, utawezekana.

30
00:01:48,111 --> 00:01:51,925
Kama hautapatikana, nitafanya nini?

31
00:01:51,949 --> 00:01:56,982
Wakati huo, tutaenda kununua mwavuli mpya pamoja.

32
00:01:57,006 --> 00:02:01,406
Nitakupatia mwavuli mzuri sana.

33
00:02:01,429 --> 00:02:03,401
Kweli?

34
00:02:03,424 --> 00:02:07,258
Eeh, kwa hiyo jikubali na uwe na nguvu.

35
00:02:07,281 --> 00:02:08,922
Asante sana.

36
00:02:08,945 --> 00:02:11,800
Nimepata nguvu kidogo.

37
00:02:11,823 --> 00:02:15,423
Sawa, kwanza tuanze na kupiga simu.

38
00:02:15,446 --> 00:02:18,646
Ndiyo, nitajaribu kupiga simu.

39
00:02:18,669 --> 00:02:25,774
Kiungo cha tovuti ambapo unaweza kukagua video ya leo kipo kwenye maelezo na maoni ya juu. *Tovuti inaweza kuondolewa bila tahadhari.

40
00:02:25,774 --> 00:02:28,774
Mstari 2: Mkutano wa Ghafla

41
00:02:28,774 --> 00:02:33,341
Eeh, je, huenda ni Ken?

42
00:02:33,364 --> 00:02:35,062
Eeh?

43
00:02:35,085 --> 00:02:38,732
Aa, ndiyo, mimi ndiye.

44
00:02:38,756 --> 00:02:42,289
Mimi ni Hana.

45
00:02:42,312 --> 00:02:46,081
Eeh! Hana?

46
00:02:46,105 --> 00:02:50,777
Ndiyo. Kweli tumeachana kwa muda mrefu.

47
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:53,266
Nimegundua ghafla.

48
00:02:53,289 --> 00:02:56,549
Kweli ni wewe Hana.

49
00:02:56,572 --> 00:03:02,139
Ndiyo. Takriban miaka kumi sasa.

50
00:03:02,162 --> 00:03:05,729
Unafanya nini hapa?

51
00:03:05,752 --> 00:03:09,352
Nimekuja kununua vitu leo.

52
00:03:09,375 --> 00:03:14,142
Nadhani. Mimi ninafanya kazi hapa.

53
00:03:14,165 --> 00:03:18,809
Je, unafanya kazi karibu na hapa?

54
00:03:18,832 --> 00:03:22,638
Ndiyo. Ofisi iko pale.

55
00:03:22,662 --> 00:03:28,064
Incredible! Huna mabadiliko yoyote.

56
00:03:28,088 --> 00:03:32,854
Hapana, nimeongeza uzito kidogo.

57
00:03:32,877 --> 00:03:37,011
Haitakuwa hivyo.

58
00:03:37,034 --> 00:03:41,967
Hana anafanya nini sasa?

59
00:03:41,990 --> 00:03:45,726
Mimi ni mwalimu wa Kiingereza.

60
00:03:45,749 --> 00:03:49,720
Je, mwalimu wa Kiingereza?

61
00:03:49,743 --> 00:03:52,176
Ni nzuri sana!

62
00:03:52,199 --> 00:03:54,133
Asante sana.

63
00:03:54,156 --> 00:03:58,989
Kila siku nina shughuli nyingi, lakini ni ya furaha.

64
00:03:59,012 --> 00:04:03,428
Nimefurahi sana kukutana nawe leo.

65
00:04:03,452 --> 00:04:09,052
Mimi pia nimegundua na ninafurahi sana.

66
00:04:09,075 --> 00:04:12,608
Una muda baada ya haya?

67
00:04:12,631 --> 00:04:17,517
Ndiyo. Saa moja hivi niko sawa.

68
00:04:17,540 --> 00:04:22,217
Basi, tutakunywa chai kwenye kafe karibu hapa?

69
00:04:22,241 --> 00:04:25,443
Sawa kabisa. Twende.

70
00:04:25,466 --> 00:04:29,433
Kuna duka la keki tamu sana.

71
00:04:29,456 --> 00:04:32,625
Waa, ninafurahi sana.

72
00:04:32,648 --> 00:04:35,882
Tutazungumza mengi.

73
00:04:35,905 --> 00:04:40,638
Ndiyo. Nina mambo mengi ya kuzungumza.

74
00:04:40,661 --> 00:04:43,833
Basi, twende.

75
00:04:43,856 --> 00:04:46,689
Ndiyo, twende.

76
00:04:46,712 --> 00:04:52,865
Kama umeelewa, tafadhali uandike maoni.

77
00:04:52,865 --> 00:04:55,865
Sehemu ya 3: Maandalizi ya Safari ya Okinawa

78
00:04:55,865 --> 00:05:00,563
Kutoka kesho tutaenda Okinawa.

79
00:05:00,587 --> 00:05:04,393
Ndiyo. Ninasisimua sana!

80
00:05:04,416 --> 00:05:08,053
Je, tayari umeandaa mizigo yako?

81
00:05:08,077 --> 00:05:11,521
Hapana, sijamaliza bado.

82
00:05:11,544 --> 00:05:15,011
Tafadhali maliza mapema.

83
00:05:15,034 --> 00:05:18,110
Navaa nguo ngapi?

84
00:05:18,133 --> 00:05:23,013
Okinawa ni joto, kwa hiyo tisheti ni nzuri.

85
00:05:23,036 --> 00:05:24,836
Nimeelewa.

86
00:05:24,860 --> 00:05:27,110
Nitabeba nyingi.

87
00:05:27,133 --> 00:05:31,310
Nafurahi sana kuogelea baharini.

88
00:05:31,333 --> 00:05:35,967
Ndiyo, mimi pia nataka kuona bahari safi.

89
00:05:35,990 --> 00:05:38,441
Je, umechukua kamera?

90
00:05:38,464 --> 00:05:41,232
Ndiyo, nimeichukua.

91
00:05:41,255 --> 00:05:44,272
Tutapiga picha nyingi.

92
00:05:44,296 --> 00:05:48,663
Ndiyo. Tutapiga picha za chakula kitamu pia.

93
00:05:48,686 --> 00:05:52,619
Aa, nataka kula soba ya Okinawa.

94
00:05:52,642 --> 00:05:54,710
Sawa kabisa.

95
00:05:54,733 --> 00:05:57,103
Mimi pia nataka kula.

96
00:05:57,127 --> 00:06:00,093
Kitabu cha mwongozo kiko wapi?

97
00:06:00,116 --> 00:06:02,319
Kiko hapa.

98
00:06:02,343 --> 00:06:05,545
Kesho usiku tutakwenda wapi?

99
00:06:05,568 --> 00:06:08,785
Je, mkahawa karibu na bahari ungependa?

100
00:06:08,809 --> 00:06:10,947
Ni nzuri sana.

101
00:06:10,970 --> 00:06:13,174
Huko tutakwenda.

102
00:06:13,198 --> 00:06:15,409
Hali ya hewa itakuwaje?

103
00:06:15,432 --> 00:06:17,883
Kesho itakuwa jua.

104
00:06:17,906 --> 00:06:19,747
Ni nzuri sana.

105
00:06:19,770 --> 00:06:22,742
Safari bora itakuwa, sivyo?

106
00:06:22,766 --> 00:06:26,766
Hehe, ndiyo, usiku huu tujipumzike mapema.

107
00:06:26,789 --> 00:06:30,995
Lakini ninaweza nikashangaa na usingizi.

108
00:06:31,018 --> 00:06:34,351
Hehe, unaonekana kama mtoto mdogo.

109
00:06:34,374 --> 00:06:37,141
Kweli kabisa.

110
00:06:37,164 --> 00:06:40,002
Lakini ninafurahia sana.

111
00:06:40,025 --> 00:06:44,226
Weka saa ya kuamsha ili tusipate kuchelewa.

112
00:06:44,250 --> 00:06:47,383
Ndiyo, tayari nimeiweka.

113
00:06:47,406 --> 00:06:51,851
Sawa, kesho tutaamka mapema, lakini tujitahidi.

114
00:06:51,874 --> 00:06:54,909
Ndiyo, na tufurahie safari yetu.

115
00:06:54,933 --> 00:06:57,933
Mstari wa 4: Jinsi ya Kutumia Mfuko Uliopotea

116
00:06:57,933 --> 00:07:00,866
Aa, nitafanya nini sasa?

117
00:07:00,889 --> 00:07:03,556
Mfuko wangu haipo.

118
00:07:03,579 --> 00:07:05,459
Eh?

119
00:07:05,482 --> 00:07:07,849
Kweli?

120
00:07:07,872 --> 00:07:11,117
Umeangalia ndani ya begi yako?

121
00:07:11,140 --> 00:07:16,607
Ndiyo, nimeangalia kila mahali, haipo.

122
00:07:16,630 --> 00:07:20,563
Unakumbuka uliupoteza wapi?

123
00:07:20,586 --> 00:07:22,919
Sijui.

124
00:07:22,942 --> 00:07:26,809
Nilikuwa nayo wakati wa ununuzi uliopita.

125
00:07:26,832 --> 00:07:29,965
Twende kituo cha polisi.

126
00:07:29,988 --> 00:07:34,887
Kuna pesa na kadi ndani yake.

127
00:07:34,911 --> 00:07:37,044
Utulivu, usijali.

128
00:07:37,067 --> 00:07:39,647
Hakika yataenda vyema.

129
00:07:39,670 --> 00:07:43,270
Je, utaipata tena?

130
00:07:43,293 --> 00:07:48,293
Polisi wa Japani ni wakarimu, itapatikana.

131
00:07:48,317 --> 00:07:50,987
Kuna kituo cha polisi hapo.

132
00:07:51,010 --> 00:07:52,777
Twende.

133
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:57,214
Samahani, kuna taarifa ya mfuko uliopotea?

134
00:07:57,237 --> 00:08:00,638
Mfuko wa ngozi nyeusi.

135
00:08:00,662 --> 00:08:04,895
Aa, afisa wa polisi amekwenda ndani.

136
00:08:04,918 --> 00:08:08,985
Ninahofia.

137
00:08:09,008 --> 00:08:11,699
Aa, ameleta kitu.

138
00:08:11,723 --> 00:08:15,456
Huyo ni mfuko wangu!

139
00:08:15,479 --> 00:08:18,012
Kweli?

140
00:08:18,035 --> 00:08:20,402
Safi sana!

141
00:08:20,426 --> 00:08:23,833
Ndiyo, ni wangu bila shaka.

142
00:08:23,857 --> 00:08:27,065
Thibitisha ndani yake.

143
00:08:27,088 --> 00:08:30,755
Pesa na kadi zote zipo.

144
00:08:30,779 --> 00:08:33,755
Safi sana.

145
00:08:33,779 --> 00:08:36,870
Nimepata raha kabisa.

146
00:08:36,893 --> 00:08:41,096
Ndiyo, moyo wangu umepumzika.

147
00:08:41,120 --> 00:08:44,686
Tunapaswa kuwashukuru wale waliouleta.

148
00:08:44,709 --> 00:08:50,276
Ndiyo, nataka kusema asante kwa mtu mwenye huruma.

149
00:08:50,299 --> 00:08:54,866
Hehe, usipoteze tena, tafadhali.

150
00:08:54,889 --> 00:08:59,228
Hehe, ndiyo, nitakuwa makini sasa.

151
00:08:59,251 --> 00:09:03,710
Sasa nimepata raha, naona nina njaa.

152
00:09:03,733 --> 00:09:09,106
Kweli, nitakupikia chakula kitamu.

153
00:09:09,130 --> 00:09:11,976
Eh, kweli?

154
00:09:11,999 --> 00:09:13,966
Ninashangaa!

155
00:09:13,989 --> 00:09:18,794
Hakika, asante kwa kuja pamoja.

156
00:09:18,817 --> 00:09:22,384
Karibu, twende.

157
00:09:22,407 --> 00:09:25,407
Mwonekano wa 5: Utangulizi wa Sifa za Simu ya Haraka ya Kisasa

158
00:09:25,407 --> 00:09:30,541
Tazama. Nimenunua simu mpya.

159
00:09:30,564 --> 00:09:35,098
Eeh, hiyo ni mfano wa hivi karibuni.

160
00:09:35,121 --> 00:09:39,728
Ndiyo. Ilitolewa jana tu.

161
00:09:39,751 --> 00:09:44,406
Nzuri sana. Ninawashwa sana.

162
00:09:44,430 --> 00:09:47,696
Skrini yake ni nzuri sana.

163
00:09:47,719 --> 00:09:52,592
Ni kweli. Ina mwendo wa kasi sana.

164
00:09:52,616 --> 00:09:56,290
Kamera yake pia ni bora sana.

165
00:09:56,313 --> 00:10:00,980
Simu yangu ni ya zamani, nawaswa sana.

166
00:10:01,003 --> 00:10:04,892
Tuchukue picha?

167
00:10:04,916 --> 00:10:06,565
Ndiyo. Tafadhali.

168
00:10:06,589 --> 00:10:10,022
Sawa, cheeze.

169
00:10:10,045 --> 00:10:15,078
Eeh, ngozi yangu inonekana nzuri sana katika picha.

170
00:10:15,102 --> 00:10:20,268
Hehehe, hata mahali penye giza inachukua picha zinazoangaza.

171
00:10:20,291 --> 00:10:24,758
Nzuri sana, natamani kuwa nayo.

172
00:10:24,781 --> 00:10:28,065
Bei yake ilikuwa ghali kidogo.

173
00:10:28,088 --> 00:10:30,259
Ilikuwa bei gani?

174
00:10:30,282 --> 00:10:32,923
Ilikuwa miaka kumi na tano elfu yenye.

175
00:10:32,947 --> 00:10:37,180
Miaka kumi na tano elfu yenye. Ghali sana.

176
00:10:37,203 --> 00:10:43,236
Lakini, nitaiutumia kila siku.

177
00:10:43,259 --> 00:10:46,259
Mimi nitaendelea kutumia simu yangu kwa miaka miwili ijayo.

178
00:10:46,282 --> 00:10:50,449
Tutumie mpaka itakapoharibika.

179
00:10:50,472 --> 00:10:55,251
Lakini, baada ya kuona simu yako, ninawashwa.

180
00:10:55,275 --> 00:10:58,875
Je, usinunue kwa bonus ya mwezi ujao?

181
00:10:58,898 --> 00:11:03,075
Bonus nitaiutumia kwa safari.

182
00:11:03,099 --> 00:11:08,232
Basi, wakati wa safari tutaweza kuchukua picha nyingi kwa simu yangu.

183
00:11:08,255 --> 00:11:11,230
Hiyo ni wazo zuri.

184
00:11:11,253 --> 00:11:16,053
Nitakupatia picha nzuri nyingi.

185
00:11:16,076 --> 00:11:17,774
Asante sana.

186
00:11:17,798 --> 00:11:19,808
Ninangojea sana.

187
00:11:19,832 --> 00:11:23,521
Lakini, ni rahisi sana kwa kweli.

188
00:11:23,544 --> 00:11:27,833
Aa, bado ninawashwa kidogo.

189
00:11:27,856 --> 00:11:32,471
Usiseme hivyo, jaribu kuikagua hapa kafini sasa hivi.

190
00:11:32,495 --> 00:11:36,136
Ni sawa? Natamani kuigusa.

191
00:11:36,159 --> 00:11:38,559
Ndiyo, karibu.

192
00:11:38,583 --> 00:11:42,316
Asante. Ninafurahi sana.

193
00:11:42,339 --> 00:11:45,339
Mwonekano wa 6: Wakati wa Tangazo la Kufaulu

194
00:11:45,339 --> 00:11:50,375
Eeh, tovuti ya matangazo ya kufaulu imefunguka.

195
00:11:50,399 --> 00:11:52,537
Ni kweli?

196
00:11:52,560 --> 00:11:55,173
Ninahisi msongo wa mawazo sana.

197
00:11:55,197 --> 00:11:58,764
Tafadhali tafuta nambari yangu.

198
00:11:58,787 --> 00:12:03,396
Eeh, nambari yako ni ipi?

199
00:12:03,419 --> 00:12:06,673
Ni nambari 10045.

200
00:12:06,696 --> 00:12:08,395
Iko?

201
00:12:08,419 --> 00:12:11,110
Niko.

202
00:12:11,133 --> 00:12:12,867
Iko hapa.

203
00:12:12,890 --> 00:12:15,423
Eeh, ni kweli?

204
00:12:15,446 --> 00:12:17,303
Kweli?

205
00:12:17,326 --> 00:12:21,060
Ndiyo, nambari 10045.

206
00:12:21,083 --> 00:12:23,616
Hongera kwa kufaulu.

207
00:12:23,639 --> 00:12:28,075
Nimefaulu! Ninafurahi sana.

208
00:12:28,098 --> 00:12:29,948
Siwezi kuamini.

209
00:12:29,972 --> 00:12:32,944
Kweli ulikuwa mzuri sana.

210
00:12:32,968 --> 00:12:37,001
Kwa sababu nilisoma sana kila siku.

211
00:12:37,024 --> 00:12:41,433
Ndiyo, nilijitahidi hadi usiku kila siku.

212
00:12:41,456 --> 00:12:44,894
Usiku wa leo tuongee na kusherehekea.

213
00:12:44,917 --> 00:12:46,752
Sawa kabisa.

214
00:12:46,775 --> 00:12:49,842
Twende kula kitu kitamu.

215
00:12:49,865 --> 00:12:52,198
Unataka kula nini?

216
00:12:52,221 --> 00:12:55,188
Nataka sushi.

217
00:12:55,211 --> 00:12:57,820
Sushi ghali pia inawezekana?

218
00:12:57,843 --> 00:13:00,735
Bila shaka, ni sawa kabisa.

219
00:13:00,759 --> 00:13:03,925
Leo mimi nitakulipa.

220
00:13:03,948 --> 00:13:06,915
Eh, kweli unaweza?

221
00:13:06,938 --> 00:13:08,706
Asante sana.

222
00:13:08,729 --> 00:13:12,263
Ni sherehe ya juhudi zako.

223
00:13:12,286 --> 00:13:14,452
Ninashangaa!

224
00:13:14,475 --> 00:13:18,875
Aa, kwa upande mwingine, una nambari yangu?

225
00:13:18,898 --> 00:13:21,565
Aa, nimesahau kabisa.

226
00:13:21,589 --> 00:13:26,222
Nambari yangu ni 10050.

227
00:13:26,245 --> 00:13:28,978
Subiri kidogo.

228
00:13:29,001 --> 00:13:30,835
Natafuta sasa.

229
00:13:30,857 --> 00:13:32,391
Imepatikana?

230
00:13:32,414 --> 00:13:33,947
Iko?

231
00:13:33,970 --> 00:13:42,403
Ee, 10048, 10049, aa, ipo!

232
00:13:42,426 --> 00:13:45,393
Nambari 10050.

233
00:13:45,416 --> 00:13:48,483
Eh, kweli ipo?

234
00:13:48,506 --> 00:13:52,120
Ndiyo, wewe pia umefaulu.

235
00:13:52,143 --> 00:13:54,110
Hongera sana.

236
00:13:54,133 --> 00:13:56,100
Tumefanya!

237
00:13:56,123 --> 00:13:58,556
Mimi pia nimefaulu.

238
00:13:58,579 --> 00:14:01,312
Ni nzuri sana.

239
00:14:01,335 --> 00:14:05,349
Ninashangilia sana kuwa wote tulifaulu.

240
00:14:05,373 --> 00:14:06,982
Ndiyo.

241
00:14:07,006 --> 00:14:09,439
Hii ni hisia nzuri kabisa.

242
00:14:09,462 --> 00:14:14,462
Basi, tuhifadhi sasa hiyo mgahawa wa sushi nzuri.

243
00:14:14,485 --> 00:14:17,958
Ndiyo, nitaita sasa hivi.

244
00:14:17,981 --> 00:14:20,981
Mstari wa 7: Huzuni ya Kukosa Tiketi za Tamasha / The Disappointment of Missing Out on Live Concert Tickets

245
00:14:20,981 --> 00:14:25,581
Matokeo ya tiketi za tamasha yamefika.

246
00:14:25,604 --> 00:14:27,404
Yalikuaje?

247
00:14:27,427 --> 00:14:29,404
Uliipata?

248
00:14:29,428 --> 00:14:32,325
Hmm, hapana.

249
00:14:32,349 --> 00:14:34,282
Sikupata.

250
00:14:34,305 --> 00:14:38,505
Eeh, ni jambo la kusikitisha sana.

251
00:14:38,528 --> 00:14:40,227
Ndiyo.

252
00:14:40,250 --> 00:14:44,817
Nilikuwa nangojea sana, kwa hiyo nina huzuni.

253
00:14:44,840 --> 00:14:47,685
Mimi pia nina huzuni.

254
00:14:47,709 --> 00:14:52,109
Nilijifunza nyimbo nyingi mpya.

255
00:14:52,132 --> 00:14:54,227
Ndiyo.

256
00:14:54,250 --> 00:14:57,017
Nilizisikiliza kila siku.

257
00:14:57,040 --> 00:15:01,073
Kwa nini sikupata?

258
00:15:01,096 --> 00:15:05,794
Kwa sababu bendi hii ni maarufu mno.

259
00:15:05,818 --> 00:15:09,691
Kununua tiketi ni vigumu sana.

260
00:15:09,714 --> 00:15:15,133
Sipendi kuacha, lakini hakuna tiketi tena.

261
00:15:15,156 --> 00:15:18,037
Tamasha siku nyingine inawezekana?

262
00:15:18,061 --> 00:15:23,228
Siku nyingine nina kazi, kwa hiyo siwezi kwenda.

263
00:15:23,251 --> 00:15:25,217
Ndiyo, naelewa.

264
00:15:25,240 --> 00:15:28,574
Hii ni kweli ni jambo la kusikitisha.

265
00:15:28,597 --> 00:15:33,830
Aa, leo sina nia ya kufanya chochote.

266
00:15:33,853 --> 00:15:35,820
Jipatie nguvu.

267
00:15:35,843 --> 00:15:41,176
Lakini mpango niliokuwa nakisubiri umefutika.

268
00:15:41,199 --> 00:15:46,081
Je, tutakwenda karaoke usiku wa leo?

269
00:15:46,105 --> 00:15:48,350
Karaoke?

270
00:15:48,373 --> 00:15:50,024
Ndiyo.

271
00:15:50,047 --> 00:15:53,681
Tutaimba nyimbo nyingi za bendi hii.

272
00:15:53,704 --> 00:15:56,674
Hiyo ni wazo zuri.

273
00:15:56,698 --> 00:16:00,065
Tutakula chakula kitamu pia.

274
00:16:00,088 --> 00:16:01,821
Asante sana.

275
00:16:01,844 --> 00:16:04,677
Nimepata nguvu kidogo.

276
00:16:04,700 --> 00:16:08,434
Karaoke karibu na kituo cha treni je, inaonekana vipi?

277
00:16:08,457 --> 00:16:11,990
Pale chumba ni pana na nzuri.

278
00:16:12,013 --> 00:16:15,313
Basi, nitahifadhi nafasi sasa hivi.

279
00:16:15,336 --> 00:16:17,213
Ndiyo, tafadhali.

280
00:16:17,237 --> 00:16:21,870
Tutaimbe nyingi ili tuisahau huzuni hiyo.

281
00:16:21,893 --> 00:16:23,427
Ndiyo.

282
00:16:23,449 --> 00:16:25,853
Nitaimba kwa nguvu zote.

283
00:16:25,877 --> 00:16:27,976
Sawa.

284
00:16:27,999 --> 00:16:30,966
Basi, tutakutana kwenye kituo cha treni.

285
00:16:30,989 --> 00:16:32,428
Ndiyo.

286
00:16:32,452 --> 00:16:34,819
Tutaonana baadaye.

287
00:16:34,841 --> 00:16:37,841
Mstari wa 8: Kupunguza Wasiwasi Kabla ya Mahojiano

288
00:16:37,841 --> 00:16:40,975
Aa, nitafanya nini sasa?

289
00:16:40,998 --> 00:16:44,372
Ninahisi wasiwasi sana.

290
00:16:44,395 --> 00:16:46,834
Utafaulu, usiwe na wasiwasi.

291
00:16:46,858 --> 00:16:48,940
Utulivu, usijali.

292
00:16:48,963 --> 00:16:52,730
Mikono yangu inachezacheza kidogo.

293
00:16:52,753 --> 00:16:56,167
Fanya uvuta pumzi kwa undani.

294
00:16:56,190 --> 00:17:02,272
Inua... pumzisha...

295
00:17:02,295 --> 00:17:07,368
Suu... haa...

296
00:17:07,392 --> 00:17:09,792
Nimepata polepole nguvu.

297
00:17:09,815 --> 00:17:13,651
Mahojiano yataanza saa ngapi?

298
00:17:13,674 --> 00:17:17,674
Yataanza baada ya dakika kumi na tano.

299
00:17:17,697 --> 00:17:20,897
Bado kuna muda.

300
00:17:20,920 --> 00:17:25,720
Ninahangaika kama nitajibu maswali vizuri.

301
00:17:25,743 --> 00:17:29,435
Tufanye mazoezi kidogo pamoja?

302
00:17:29,459 --> 00:17:31,869
Ndiyo. Tafadhali.

303
00:17:31,893 --> 00:17:35,426
Kwa nini unataka kufanya kazi katika duka hili?

304
00:17:35,449 --> 00:17:40,849
Ninapenda sana kahawa na keki za hapa.

305
00:17:40,872 --> 00:17:43,124
Sawa kabisa.

306
00:17:43,148 --> 00:17:47,953
Watu wa hapa pia ni wazuri.

307
00:17:47,976 --> 00:17:49,910
Ndiyo.

308
00:17:49,933 --> 00:17:54,799
Wafanyakazi wote hapa huwa na tabasamu.

309
00:17:54,822 --> 00:17:58,227
Jibu zuri sana!

310
00:17:58,250 --> 00:18:00,817
Kuwa na imani na uwezo wako.

311
00:18:00,840 --> 00:18:02,573
Asante sana.

312
00:18:02,596 --> 00:18:06,996
Unaweza kufanya kazi siku ngapi kwa wiki?

313
00:18:07,019 --> 00:18:10,653
Naweza kufanya kazi kwa siku tatu.

314
00:18:10,676 --> 00:18:14,163
Jumamosi na Jumapili pia ninaweza.

315
00:18:14,186 --> 00:18:19,753
Hiyo itawafurahisha watu wa hapa.

316
00:18:19,776 --> 00:18:22,109
Kweli?

317
00:18:22,132 --> 00:18:27,999
Ndiyo, watu wanaoweza kufanya kazi Jumamosi na Jumapili ni muhimu sana.

318
00:18:28,022 --> 00:18:31,222
Nimepata polepole raha.

319
00:18:31,245 --> 00:18:35,081
Utafaulu bila shaka.

320
00:18:35,104 --> 00:18:39,183
Nimefurahi sana uliyeandama.

321
00:18:39,206 --> 00:18:43,140
Kwa sababu wewe ni rafiki yangu.

322
00:18:43,163 --> 00:18:46,563
Ndiyo. Nitapiga hodi kwa bidii.

323
00:18:46,586 --> 00:18:51,989
Nita kivinjari hapa baada ya mahojiano.

324
00:18:52,013 --> 00:18:54,981
Sawa. Nitakutumia ujumbe baada ya kumaliza.

325
00:18:55,004 --> 00:18:57,222
Safari njema!

326
00:18:57,246 --> 00:18:59,337
Nakutia moyo.

327
00:18:59,360 --> 00:19:02,975
Ninaenda sasa.

328
00:19:02,999 --> 00:19:05,999
Mstari wa 9: Kugundua tisheti imeviringishwa / Kugundua T-Shati Imevalishwa Kinyumenyume

329
00:19:05,999 --> 00:19:10,080
Kahawa leo ni ya kimya sana na nzuri, sivyo?

330
00:19:10,103 --> 00:19:11,970
Ndiyo.

331
00:19:11,993 --> 00:19:15,050
Kahawa pia ni tamu sana.

332
00:19:15,073 --> 00:19:20,673
Eeh, naomba nikwambie jambo dogo...

333
00:19:20,696 --> 00:19:22,229
Nini?

334
00:19:22,252 --> 00:19:24,485
Una shida gani?

335
00:19:24,508 --> 00:19:29,708
Tisheti yako, labda umevalisha kinyumenyume?

336
00:19:29,731 --> 00:19:31,430
Eeh?

337
00:19:31,454 --> 00:19:33,587
Kuhusu nini?

338
00:19:33,610 --> 00:19:36,943
Mbele na nyuma zimebadilishwa.

339
00:19:36,966 --> 00:19:39,009
Lebo inaonekana.

340
00:19:39,033 --> 00:19:42,366
Aa, si kweli!

341
00:19:42,389 --> 00:19:44,356
Kweli?

342
00:19:44,379 --> 00:19:45,512
Ndiyo.

343
00:19:45,535 --> 00:19:50,335
Lebo inayopaswa kuwa nyuma ya shingo iko mbele.

344
00:19:50,358 --> 00:19:54,217
Eeh, kweli kabisa. Naona aibu.

345
00:19:54,241 --> 00:19:56,207
He he he.

346
00:19:56,230 --> 00:19:58,831
Umevalisha hivyo tangu lini?

347
00:19:58,854 --> 00:20:03,033
Tangu asubuhi nilikuwa hivyo.

348
00:20:03,057 --> 00:20:05,535
Uliingia kwenye treni, sivyo?

349
00:20:05,558 --> 00:20:07,391
Ndiyo.

350
00:20:07,414 --> 00:20:10,153
Niliingia kwenye treni yenye watu wengi mno.

351
00:20:10,176 --> 00:20:13,343
Ulienda dukani pia, sivyo?

352
00:20:13,366 --> 00:20:15,138
Ndiyo.

353
00:20:15,161 --> 00:20:18,161
Nilikula na mfanyakazi wa duka.

354
00:20:18,184 --> 00:20:22,022
Hakuna aliyenikwambia chochote.

355
00:20:22,046 --> 00:20:26,779
Aa, ndiyo maana kila mtu alikuwa ananitazama.

356
00:20:26,802 --> 00:20:28,935
He he he.

357
00:20:28,958 --> 00:20:31,125
Naona aibu sana.

358
00:20:31,148 --> 00:20:35,194
Uso wangu unachemsha mno.

359
00:20:35,217 --> 00:20:39,475
Haraka uende choo kukibadilisha.

360
00:20:39,499 --> 00:20:41,143
Ndiyo.

361
00:20:41,166 --> 00:20:43,099
Nitakwenda sasa hivi.

362
00:20:43,122 --> 00:20:46,656
Weka begi yako hapa.

363
00:20:46,679 --> 00:20:48,445
Nitakuangalia.

364
00:20:48,468 --> 00:20:50,083
Asante sana.

365
00:20:50,107 --> 00:20:52,440
Nitakimbia kwenda.

366
00:20:52,463 --> 00:20:55,348
Haya, ingia salama.

367
00:20:55,371 --> 00:20:59,385
Aa, siku yangu ya aibu kabisa.

368
00:20:59,409 --> 00:21:01,942
Utafaulu, usiwe na wasiwasi.

369
00:21:01,965 --> 00:21:04,639
Hakuna anayekujali.

370
00:21:04,663 --> 00:21:07,533
Ningependa kuamini hivyo.

371
00:21:07,556 --> 00:21:11,690
Haraka uende na urudi baada ya kujisikia vizuri.

372
00:21:11,712 --> 00:21:13,487
Ndiyo.

373
00:21:13,511 --> 00:21:15,401
Nitarudi haraka.

374
00:21:15,425 --> 00:21:17,558
He he he.

375
00:21:17,581 --> 00:21:20,314
Usiharakishe, uende polepole.

376
00:21:20,337 --> 00:21:23,337
Mstari wa 10: Jinsi ya Kuomba Msamaha kwa Kuchelewa / Jinsi ya Kuomba Msamaha kwa Kuchelewa

377
00:21:23,337 --> 00:21:26,304
Umechelewa sana kweli.

378
00:21:26,327 --> 00:21:30,127
Tayari imepita nusu saa.

379
00:21:30,150 --> 00:21:34,083
Samahani kwa kuchelewa.

380
00:21:34,106 --> 00:21:37,706
Kwa nini hukutuma ujumbe?

381
00:21:37,729 --> 00:21:42,199
Betri ya simu yangu imekwisha.

382
00:21:42,223 --> 00:21:47,389
Hata ikiisha betri, unaweza kutumia simu ya umma.

383
00:21:47,412 --> 00:21:52,146
Samahani, sikufikiria hata kidogo.

384
00:21:52,169 --> 00:21:56,902
Nimekuwa nikikupigia moyo hapa.

385
00:21:56,925 --> 00:22:00,860
Ninakuomba msamaha kwa dhati.

386
00:22:00,883 --> 00:22:03,979
Wewe huchelewa kila wakati.

387
00:22:04,002 --> 00:22:06,493
Wiki iliyopita pia ilikuwa hivyo.

388
00:22:06,517 --> 00:22:10,756
Ndiyo. Nakushukuru sana kwa kuvumilia daima.

389
00:22:10,780 --> 00:22:15,648
Kuzingatia muda ni muhimu sana.

390
00:22:15,671 --> 00:22:18,838
Ndiyo, nafahamu.

391
00:22:18,861 --> 00:22:23,094
Ninaona unahusu muda wangu kama si muhimu.

392
00:22:23,117 --> 00:22:26,084
Si kweli.

393
00:22:26,107 --> 00:22:28,960
Ninajuta sana.

394
00:22:28,983 --> 00:22:34,723
Filamu ambayo nilikuwa nikitarajia leo imeshaanza tayari.

395
00:22:34,746 --> 00:22:35,913
Eeh?

396
00:22:35,936 --> 00:22:38,184
Ni kweli?

397
00:22:38,208 --> 00:22:42,808
Ndiyo. Sikupata kuona dakika kumi na tano za kwanza.

398
00:22:42,831 --> 00:22:46,901
Aa, pole sana kwa hilo.

399
00:22:46,924 --> 00:22:50,059
Kwa nini huchelewa daima?

400
00:22:50,083 --> 00:22:54,771
Asubuhi niliamka kuchelewa.

401
00:22:54,795 --> 00:22:58,528
Tumia saa za kuzindua nyingi.

402
00:22:58,551 --> 00:23:01,985
Ndiyo, kuanzia leo nitazifanya hivyo.

403
00:23:02,009 --> 00:23:07,009
Sipendi kukasirika, lakini ninahuzunika sana.

404
00:23:07,032 --> 00:23:09,504
Tafadhali, niwie radhi.

405
00:23:09,527 --> 00:23:12,897
Tiketi ya baadaye nitanunua mimi.

406
00:23:12,920 --> 00:23:15,977
Si suala la pesa.

407
00:23:16,001 --> 00:23:20,018
Ndiyo, ni suala la hisia.

408
00:23:20,041 --> 00:23:24,246
Usichelewe tena kwa hakika.

409
00:23:24,269 --> 00:23:27,203
Ndiyo, niahidi.

410
00:23:27,226 --> 00:23:29,592
Hakika sitachelewa tena.

411
00:23:29,615 --> 00:23:31,649
Nimeelewa.

412
00:23:31,672 --> 00:23:34,105
Kwa sasa nitakuruhusu.

413
00:23:34,128 --> 00:23:36,132
Asante sana.

414
00:23:36,155 --> 00:23:38,922
Haraka twende sinema.

415
00:23:38,945 --> 00:23:41,911
Ndiyo, haraka tuende.